@* Code on a page (F164.1): named for its file or its language, with a button that asks the site's agent about it
   (F164.2) and one that copies it as it stands, the code itself as text, never read as markup. The header's layout is
   Bootstrap's (ADR 0085). *@
<figure class="code-listing">
    <figcaption class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-3">
        <span>@Label</span>
        <span class="d-flex gap-2">
            <button type="button" class="code-ask" @onclick="Ask">@Text.AskCode</button>
            <button type="button" class="code-copy" @onclick="CopyAsync">@CopyWord</button>
        </span>
    </figcaption>
    <pre><code class="language-@Language">@Code</code></pre>
</figure>
